NAME
    gcloud alpha network-management network-monitoring-providers web-paths - a
        Web Path represents a monitored web application or URL, assessed from a
        monitoring point to measure performance and availability

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha network-management network-monitoring-providers web-paths
        COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) A Web Path represents a monitored web application or URL, assessed
    from a monitoring point to measure performance and availability.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (ALPHA) Describe a Web Path.

     list
        (ALPHA) List Web Paths.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist.

